D. the coherent return (by unitarity: the inverse swap on the same joint state, before Q rethermalises):
   forward W = 0.268941, reverse W = -0.268941, net 0: the record un-written, nothing erased, nothing gained

E. how fast memory makes power: P <= k_B T ln2 x (fresh bits per second)
   room temperature, 1 Gbit/s  : 2.871e-12 W
   chip at 20 mK, 10 Gbit/s    : 1.914e-15 W
   room temperature, 1 Tbit/s  : 2.871e-09 W
